<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #6b46c1;
            --primary-hover: #553c9a;
            --bg-color: #fcfaff;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --text-main: #2d3748;
            --border-color: #e9d8fd;
            --danger: #e53e3e;
            --danger-hover: #c53030;
            --warning-bg: #fffaf0;
            --warning-border: #ed8936;
            --error-bg: #fff5f5;
            --error-border: #fc8181;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        header {
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(107, 70, 193, 0.2);
        }

        main {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        .form-container {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 2.5rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(107, 70, 193, 0.1);
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 500px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .form-container h2 {
            margin-top: 0;
            color: var(--text-main);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .alert {
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            text-align: left;
            line-height: 1.5;
            border-left: 5px solid;
        }

        .alert-error {
            background-color: var(--error-bg);
            border-left-color: var(--danger);
            color: #9b2c2c;
        }

        .alert-warning {
            background-color: var(--warning-bg);
            border-left-color: var(--warning-border);
            color: #9c4221;
        }

        .actions {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .btn {
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: background-color 0.2s;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: var(--primary-hover);
        }

        .btn-cancel {
            background-color: white;
            color: var(--text-main);
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e0;
            transition: background-color 0.2s;
        }

        .btn-cancel:hover {
            background-color: #f7fafc;
        }

        .btn-danger {
            background-color: var(--danger);
            color: white;
            border: none;
        }

        .btn-danger:hover {
            background-color: var(--danger-hover);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Chez Maymouna</h1>
    </header>

    <main>
        <div class="form-container">
            <h2>Supprimer la catégorie</h2>
            
            <% if (hasIngredients) { %>
                
                <div class="alert alert-error">
                    <strong>Action impossible :</strong> La catégorie <em>"<%= category.name %>"</em> contient encore des ingrédients. 
                    <br><br>
                    Pour protéger votre base de données, vous devez d'abord supprimer ou déplacer ces ingrédients avant de pouvoir supprimer cette catégorie.
                </div>
                
                <div class="actions">
                    <a href="/categories/<%= category.id %>" class="btn">Retour aux détails</a>
                </div>

            <% } else { %>

                <div class="alert alert-warning">
                    Êtes-vous sûr de vouloir supprimer définitivement la catégorie <strong>"<%= category.name %>"</strong> ?
                    <br><br>
                    Cette action est irréversible.
                </div>
                
                <form action="/categories/<%= category.id %>/delete" method="POST">
                    <div class="actions">
                        <a href="/categories/<%= category.id %>" class="btn-cancel">Annuler</a>
                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-danger">Confirmer la suppression</button>
                    </div>
                </form>

            <% } %>

        </div>
    </main>

</body>
</html>
